  title: B R I G H T   I D E A
  button: BRIGHT IDEA
  riddle: A clock, a pencil cup, sticky notes, an eraser and three things to write
    with. It is late, and something is coming.
  hint: Hold the light low, below the pile. The clock is round; the cup and the notes
    make the base; the pens shine.
  complete: 'BRIGHT IDEA

    The desk at midnight, just before it clicks.'
  accent: {r: 0.98, g: 0.85, b: 0.35, a: 1}
